# Copy to .env only if you run this outside Muse. Never commit a real .env.
# In Muse, all credentials come from the secure store (custom.openai,
# custom.gemini, custom.tavily) via the surrogate helper — no key is
# needed here, and no key is ever printed or logged.
# Optional overrides (placeholders only):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=<your-openai-api-key>
# TAVILY_API_KEY=<your-tavily-api-key>
# GEMINI_API_KEY=<your-gemini-api-key>
